# Double Down copies a Kindred Instant with Changeling: it is every creature type, so an outlaw (CR 700.12, 702.73a; ruling
# 2024-04-12). "Copy that spell" gives no new targets, so the copy keeps the original's target (CR 707.10) and no target question is asked (`! Bot1.Target`): with Bot2's Memnite also on
# the battlefield, Bot1's Nameless Inversion (+3/-3) on Deepmuck Desperado is copied and both resolve on the Desperado (4 toughness:
# 5/1 after the copy, then 8/-2), which dies; Memnite is untouched.

